Z||000000||88formula||01-09-2000||08:51 PM||||Has anyone used the Sprint headers sold at the fiero store? What other companies sell headers for the fiero? How do headers compare to ported fiero exhaust manifolds?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Ed||01-09-2000||09:31 PM||||And are any of these headers street legal in California?  ||||reg||5
Z||000002||TOM||01-09-2000||09:58 PM||||Is anything legal in CA?||||reg||1
Z||000003||Raydar||01-09-2000||10:04 PM||||If memory serves, Ed Parks said that the ported/welded stock manifolds flow nearly as much as the Sprint manifolds. Not nearly as sexy, though. FOCOA sells tuned headers, as well. (If you can ever get them to respond.)<p>[This message has been edited by Raydar (edited 01-09-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000004||SCCA FIERO||01-09-2000||10:57 PM||||I think walking is legal in California. I heard since the state can't tax you for walking, the police are instructed to beat the crap out of anyone walking.||||reg||10
